{"steam_appid":3183760,"steam_name":"SpeedRunners 2: King of Speed","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3183760/255180027/42029f1da70affb5640a1b396da1ab4ae1ebdba7/1788449704/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1788454619","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257416608/a795dc6f2a0ede9b835f69bb91b3ba23b3754e06/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1788454619","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183760/3f73442944d4f9d95251bb24753f4493f9401951/ss_3f73442944d4f9d95251bb24753f4493f9401951.1920x1080.jpg?t=1788467143","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183760/32c56d0798b4e4a187b920ee92f950b1d81034a8/ss_32c56d0798b4e4a187b920ee92f950b1d81034a8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1788467143","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183760/d0284b6dc544f0d8c7dd392c75b65b8e972078a8/ss_d0284b6dc544f0d8c7dd392c75b65b8e972078a8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1788467143","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183760/ee998fd860a6f0bb258efb3fb2dc43f5df7ccabd/ss_ee998fd860a6f0bb258efb3fb2dc43f5df7ccabd.1920x1080.jpg?t=1788467143","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183760/2bc821fdaf9055a1bd4dc9974ddcffd33462427d/ss_2bc821fdaf9055a1bd4dc9974ddcffd33462427d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1788467143"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183760/extras/73a3dbb14c69a1e154bea31ae17bfa56.poster.avif?t=1788467143\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183760/extras/73a3dbb14c69a1e154bea31ae17bfa56.webm?t=1788467143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183760/extras/73a3dbb14c69a1e154bea31ae17bfa56.mp4?t=1788467143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your friendships via local multiplayer or compete with runners worldwide in this sequel to the acclaimed competitive platformer – now with up to 8 players per online lobby, upgraded netcode, new characters and power-ups, high-stakes elimination tournaments, explosive story campaign, and a variety of new multiplayer modes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GOTTA GO FAST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183760/extras/979c8aeaf0801e62e400d5ba0eeaf446.poster.avif?t=1788467143\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183760/extras/979c8aeaf0801e62e400d5ba0eeaf446.webm?t=1788467143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183760/extras/979c8aeaf0801e62e400d5ba0eeaf446.mp4?t=1788467143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the movement: build momentum, swing with a grappling hook, and outmaneuver opponents using speed boosters, shortcuts, and traps scattered across maps.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TOOLS OF DESTRUCTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183760/extras/82a7128fd2d81f442120072ada362a2f.poster.avif?t=1788467143\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183760/extras/82a7128fd2d81f442120072ada362a2f.webm?t=1788467143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183760/extras/82a7128fd2d81f442120072ada362a2f.mp4?t=1788467143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash an arsenal of power-ups, featuring fan-favorites like fireballs, freeze rays, and golden hooks alongside new additions like blasters and portable teleporters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SAVE THE DAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183760/extras/f5e758937fb8115922876e4614c4c879.poster.avif?t=1788467143\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183760/extras/f5e758937fb8115922876e4614c4c879.webm?t=1788467143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183760/extras/f5e758937fb8115922876e4614c4c879.mp4?t=1788467143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save New Rush City, meet new and returning heroes, and gear up for multiplayer mayhem in a campaign that expands the original story and lore.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HILARIOUS PVP CHAOS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183760/extras/eaa14bb43b13cfbc6e89f874501600a7.poster.avif?t=1788467143\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183760/extras/eaa14bb43b13cfbc6e89f874501600a7.webm?t=1788467143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183760/extras/eaa14bb43b13cfbc6e89f874501600a7.mp4?t=1788467143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kick back in Quick Play, get sweaty in Ranked, compete in brand-new 64-player elimination tournaments, or check out a variety of rule-bending modes in the Playground.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Chaotic 2D racing for up to 8 players online</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Fluid, high-skill movement system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 12 playable characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Dozens of unlockable cosmetic items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Expanded arsenal of new and returning power-ups</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 16 map layouts with unique challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Local multiplayer &amp; custom games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• New experimental, rule-bending modes </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Explosive story campaign</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 64-player elimination tournaments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Competitive Ranked play</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Win 10 x64<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 5 1600, Core i3-8100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1660 Super<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD is recommended. System requirements are subject to change</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Casual","Indie","Racing","Sports","Free To Play"],"developers":["Fair Play Labs"],"publishers":["tinyBuild"],"release_date":"Sep 3, 2026"}